<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kimberly-Clark cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kimberly-Clark cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst C.A. Dillon downgraded Kimberly-Clark Corp to hold from buy on the basis of price.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that ... much of the progress expected over the next six to 12 months is in the stock price and therefore expect the stock to move more in line with the market,&quot; Dillon said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1-7/8 at 86-1/4.</p>
</text>
